; ───────────────────────────────────────── problem 4: the see-saw and the crate
;
; The crate is LIGHTER than the hero (8 against 10) and still wins from the
; middle, because `WeightSensor.moment` is mass times distance from the pivot.
; Leverage is the one thing about a see-saw a player can work out unaided.
