; ────────────────────────────────── problem 6: the giant is the wall-breaker
;
; `break_mass` 30 against his 40, with `break_speed` 999 and the slam route off.
; **He walks at 3 m/s and can therefore never clear a speed gate**, which is
; exactly why a wall meant for a giant has to ask about his weight instead —
; and it makes him a tool you aim rather than an obstacle you fight.

