; ─────────────────────────── problem 2: the island, and problem 8: the exit
;
; The island treasure is worth 70 and is OPTIONAL, which is the rule about
; gates: a charge-jump on the critical path would strand anyone who cannot do
; it. The exit sits on the main ground where everyone can reach it.

[node name="TreasureIsland" parent="." instance=ExtResource("chest")]
